Hi Joel,

You are quite correct that one must sort the data by stratum label and
sample (transect) label before importing it.  This is in the help page
"Introduction to Data Import", after the short example file, but I agree it
is rather crypic:
"Notice that all transects from the same stratum are grouped together, and
all observations from the same transect are grouped together."

I have added another paragraph on this to that help page which makes it more
explicit, and gives an example of what happens if you don't sort correctly.
Hopefully this, and your posting, will help people avoid the same problems
you had.  The new help page will come out with the next release of Distance.

Cheers,

 - Len Thomas

